        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 12px">The LG DLE3400W is a modern front-load electric dryer. At $510.31 for an isolated heating element failure, repair can be a reasonable choice compared to replacing the appliance, particularly when the rest of the dryer is in good mechanical condition.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 12px">Replacement may make more sense when drum bearings or other major mechanical systems are also failing, when multiple expensive components have failed, when there is physical damage, or when the total repair cost approaches the realistic cost of a comparable replacement dryer.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:#6a7a8e;line-height:1.65;padding:12px 16px;background:#f0f2f7;border:1px solid rgba(30,50,80,0.07);border-radius:10px;margin:0">This was the total for this specific repair. Another DLE3400W with the same no-heat complaint may require a different component and a different repair price.</p>
